    "A faint melody plays around you; others can hear it too.",
    "A spectral maiden appears, scolds you, then fades.",
    "Your hair falls out and regrows lavender.",
    "A small flame follows you, shedding light, for 1 minute.",
    "You cast Levitate on yourself (your choice of direction).",
    "Your voice booms for 1 minute; everyone nearby can hear you clearly.",
    "A badger appears, chatters angrily, and runs off.",
    "You shrink to the size of a mouse for 1 minute.",
    "You grow to Large size for 1 minute.",
